{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls End is a tactical auto-battler roguelike with inventory-management elements. You'll build an army from the ground up, combining units, items and relics to form synergistic builds as you battle your way through enemy armies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Placement Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart placement strategy of items and units is rewarded and can be the difference between a hard loss or an easy victory. Shape your army your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/5420e3e4e000b05ee8d018a0c092b0a8.poster.avif?t=1770484443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/5420e3e4e000b05ee8d018a0c092b0a8.webm?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/5420e3e4e000b05ee8d018a0c092b0a8.mp4?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Huge Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge epic and chaotic battles unfold in Souls End. Will you build your army tall with only the strongest of units, or will you swarm your enemies with a horde of stinky goblins?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/47ab842585e504e693fb70936b672694.poster.avif?t=1770484443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/47ab842585e504e693fb70936b672694.webm?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/47ab842585e504e693fb70936b672694.mp4?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spell Casting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells  can be cast during battles to help tip the scales in your favor. Some builds may even be defined by the different spells tied to the soul you pick at the start of each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/334e2f1ab67bbaebe1b956d44ef7260e.poster.avif?t=1770484443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/334e2f1ab67bbaebe1b956d44ef7260e.webm?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/334e2f1ab67bbaebe1b956d44ef7260e.mp4?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569020?t=1770484443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/72e01630d60b79ddabc8fc031115b387b75ca99a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770484443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/823f57c7606460f50607773ddbc218c1733e6d37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770484443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/823f57c7606460f50607773ddbc218c1733e6d37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770484443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls End is a tactical auto-battler roguelike with inventory-management elements. You'll build an army from the ground up, combining units, items and relics to form synergistic builds as you battle your way through enemy armies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Placement Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart placement strategy of items and units is rewarded and can be the difference between a hard loss or an easy victory. Shape your army your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/5420e3e4e000b05ee8d018a0c092b0a8.poster.avif?t=1770484443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/5420e3e4e000b05ee8d018a0c092b0a8.webm?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/5420e3e4e000b05ee8d018a0c092b0a8.mp4?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Huge Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge epic and chaotic battles unfold in Souls End. Will you build your army tall with only the strongest of units, or will you swarm your enemies with a horde of stinky goblins?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/47ab842585e504e693fb70936b672694.poster.avif?t=1770484443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/47ab842585e504e693fb70936b672694.webm?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/47ab842585e504e693fb70936b672694.mp4?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spell Casting\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells  can be cast during battles to help tip the scales in your favor. Some builds may even be defined by the different spells tied to the soul you pick at the start of each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/334e2f1ab67bbaebe1b956d44ef7260e.poster.avif?t=1770484443\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/334e2f1ab67bbaebe1b956d44ef7260e.webm?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/extras/334e2f1ab67bbaebe1b956d44ef7260e.mp4?t=1770484443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Ruu"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569020/a8fa94238dd7b6623ea5e6250e8c3f9cf727cc81/header.jpg?t=1770484443","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3569020/1643890852/2dc23e8a94eedee690641ce93a47b3ef30e75c55/1763586383/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767734018","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3569020/1643890852/2dc23e8a94eedee690641ce93a47b3ef30e75c55/1763586383/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767734018","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3569020/1643890852/2dc23e8a94eedee690641ce93a47b3ef30e75c55/1763586383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767734018","id":257234584,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257234584/bbbdc6c1ff1169927f46dcc923810d982b5b2634/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767734018"}],"name":"Souls End","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Pro